  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.5:\n - removed Microsoft.Build.NoTargets/3.7.56 dependency. Now applying the same logic using our fork so that we are in control.\n\nv1.0.4: \n - Added default project type which enables .pcfproj to be added using the following command `dotnet sln mySolution.sln add ...`\n\nv1.0.3: \n - Added support for Directory.props global package versioning\n\nv1.0.2: \n - Update Manifest version by specifying FileVersion property\n \nv1.0.1: \n - Improved packages documentation and icon\n \nv1.0.0:\n - First release of AlbanianXrm.PCFProj.Sdk",
